@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary GroupManagementInterface
control GroupController
control GroupService
control GroupMemberController
control GroupMemberService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

Lecturer -> GroupManagementInterface: Request group list
GroupManagementInterface -> GroupController: GET /api/groups
GroupController -> GroupService: Retrieve group information
GroupService -> Database: Fetch group details and member lists
Database --> GroupService: Return group details and member lists
GroupService --> GroupController: Return group information
GroupController --> GroupManagementInterface: Return group information

Lecturer -> GroupManagementInterface: View group details
GroupManagementInterface -> GroupController: GET /api/groups/{groupId}
GroupController -> GroupService: Fetch detailed group information
GroupService -> Database: Fetch detailed information
Database --> GroupService: Return detailed group information
GroupService --> GroupController: Return detailed group information
GroupController --> GroupManagementInterface: Return detailed group information

Lecturer -> GroupManagementInterface: Request to remove group member
GroupManagementInterface -> GroupMemberController: DELETE /api/groups/{groupId}/members/{memberId}
GroupMemberController -> GroupMemberService: Remove group member
GroupMemberService -> Database: Update group composition
Database --> GroupMemberService: Return update status
GroupMemberService --> GroupMemberController: Return removal status
GroupMemberController --> GroupManagementInterface: Return removal status

alt Removal successful
    GroupManagementInterface -> NotificationService: Notify removed member
    NotificationService -> GroupMember: Send removal notification
    NotificationService --> GroupManagementInterface: Return notification status
else Removal failed
    GroupManagementInterface -> Lecturer: Display error message
end

GroupManagementInterface -> Lecturer: Display group management status

@enduml
